WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.164
Watch and read: While at the market, Ama thinks about this: Your paragraph repeats

00:00:05.164 --> 00:00:07.645
one idea three times. What revision helps?

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:13.494
The answer is: Remove repetition and add a relevant detail. Revision improves the

00:00:13.494 --> 00:00:14.658
ideas and flow.

00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:20.747
Watch and read: Kojo is learning with a partner at school. Which change improves an

00:00:20.747 --> 00:00:21.443
unclear story?

00:00:22.283 --> 00:00:27.531
The answer is: Explain why the character acted. Revising adds useful information.
